@echo off
title RAB Addon Updater
echo ================================================================
echo   RAB Addon Updater - finds every Minecraft data folder the
echo   launcher actually uses, clears old RAB builds, installs the
echo   newest one, and keeps your worlds bound to it.
echo   Close Minecraft first.
echo ================================================================
echo.
set "RAB_B64=%TEMP%\rab-update.b64"
if exist "%RAB_B64%" del "%RAB_B64%" >nul 2>&1
>>"%RAB_B64%" echo 
>>"%RAB_B64%" echo 
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command "$b=(Get-Content -Raw $env:RAB_B64) -replace '\s',''; $s=[Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetString([Convert]::FromBase64String($b)); $p=Join-Path $env:TEMP 'rab-updater.ps1'; [IO.File]::WriteAllText($p,$s,[Text.Encoding]::UTF8); Remove-Item $env:RAB_B64 -Force; & $p"
echo.
pause
